  "goodToKnow": "Der Republikaner (die Republikanerin) is a republican, someone who supports a republic rather than a monarchy, and a member of the US Republican Party: die Republikaner, as opposed to die Demokraten. In German history, die Republikaner was also the name of a small far-right party from the 1980s. Germany itself is a republic: die Bundesrepublik Deutschland, founded in 1949, after the Weimar Republic of 1919–1933."
